{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础篇","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/backend-internationalization/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"i18n-architecture-patterns","title":"国际化架构模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/backend-internationalization/foundations/i18n-architecture-patterns","wordCount":1607,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"unicode-encoding-normalization","title":"Unicode 编码与规范化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/backend-internationalization/foundations/unicode-encoding-normalization","wordCount":1611,"readingTime":7},{"seq":3,"slug":"locale-detection-negotiation","title":"区域检测与内容协商","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/backend-internationalization/foundations/locale-detection-negotiation","wordCount":1365,"readingTime":6}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"基础篇\">基础篇</h1><p>基础篇建立后端国际化的架构视角和核心机制。三篇文档分别覆盖：如何设计 i18n 架构使业务逻辑与 locale 解耦、Unicode 编码在后端存储和比较中的正确实践、以及服务端如何检测用户区域并完成内容协商。这些是所有后续章节的共同前提——数据处理和翻译管道的正确性都建立在编码规范化和 locale 路由正确的基础之上。</p>\n"}